// IntroString :
"P1239841083" "So there is a new hero snooping around Grandville. Crey wants to know exactly who we are dealing with, but they don't have good intel on the guy. He recently raided a Council facility however, so perhaps their records can shed light on who we are dealing with. Why don't you visit that facility and grab a copy of their surveillance tapes? That should give us an indication of who is trying to mess with Crey."
// AcceptString :
"P969847846" "Steal surveillance tapes from the Council"
// SendOffString :
"P3866194837" "Get in there, grab the tapes, and get out. You don't need to mess with those Council goons... unless you want to, that is."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1402409112" "Steal tapes from the Council"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1329711718" "You got those tapes yet? We're trying to figure out just who we're dealing with here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
