// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2783999022" "OK, so my research into this Synapse character tells me he used to be an average guy. Any normal person can be bought for a price. I found out that Arachnos has got their hands on some gold doubloons from a shipwreck off the coast. If you can steal that, then we can have a nice lump sum that should be able to send Synapse packing, and leave us alone. I'm going to put the word out for him to meet you once you've got the gold. If he really has left his mercenary days behind him you might be up for a fight though, so be prepared. <color orange>I'd take a few allies along with you as backup... just in case.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3691764997" "Steal gold from Arachnos to bribe Synapse"
// SendOffString :
"P787509149" "Once you have the gold, Synapse will find you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1572433781" "Steal gold from Arachnos"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1926698254" "You need to get that gold from Arachnos. Only then will I get word to Synapse to meet you."

