"P2519953054" "So the stolen formula wasn't even in the Malta base? That's disappointing. I know you must have tried your best. We did have an incident while you were out, though. Someone broke into a Crey lab and stole a project we were working on. We tried to contact you to take care of it, but couldn't get a hold of you."

