"P2679187198" "Well, that was record time. I just got word that Synapse busted Mynx out of the facility. Man, he is fast. Fortunately, we planned for this and now know the location where he is hiding out. Looks like he's got what he came for, so he's prepping to bug out. Are you up for a little payback, Crey style? <color orange>This is a timed mission, you will have 45 minutes to complete it</color>."
